```
 * [Subject-1
---------
Content-1](https://Link-1/)
* [Subject2
--------
Content-2](https://Link2/)

```
The light theme in CSS is 
```
.link-card-grid {
 display: grid;
 grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(24ch, 1fr));
 gap: 1rem;
 padding: 0;
}

.link-card > a {
